%% title: Idempotent financial posting sequence
%% last_updated: 2026-07-28
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI
    participant Route
    participant Guard as Workspace guard
    participant Posting as executePosting
    participant DB as Azure SQL transaction

    User->>UI: Submit money-changing action
    UI->>Route: Request + Idempotency-Key
    Route->>Guard: Require EDITOR membership
    Guard-->>Route: userId + workspaceId
    Route->>Posting: operation, request hash, actor, callback
    Posting->>DB: Acquire scoped idempotency/journal claim
    alt Existing matching completed request
        DB-->>Posting: Stored result
        Posting-->>Route: Replay result
    else Key reused with different request
        Posting-->>Route: Conflict
    else New request
        Posting->>DB: Create PostingGroup and ledger rows
        Posting->>DB: Apply budget deltas and complete record
        DB-->>Posting: Commit result
        Posting-->>Route: New result
    end
    Route-->>UI: Result + X-Request-Id
